sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Operator as Authorized human
    participant UI as Workspace UI / SDK
    participant API as Import API
    participant Stage as Tenant staging store
    participant Worker as Validation worker
    participant Ledger as Tenant ledger database
    participant Audit as Append-only audit log

    Note over Operator,Audit: Logical Phase 1 — stage and validate. No live ledger writes.
    Operator->>UI: Select authorized ZIP package
    UI->>UI: Hash package and validate request shape
    UI->>API: POST /v1/import-batches<br/>Idempotency-Key: K1
    API->>API: Verify workspace session, membership, import permission
    API->>Stage: Create batch B (upload_pending)<br/>bind K1 to canonical request digest
    API-->>UI: 201 batch B + one upload path

    alt Same K1 + same canonical request
        UI->>API: POST /v1/import-batches (retry, K1)
        API-->>UI: 201 original batch B response (no duplicate batch)
    else Same K1 + different canonical request
        UI->>API: POST /v1/import-batches (conflict, K1)
        API-->>UI: 409 IMPORT-BATCH-002
    end

    UI->>API: PUT /v1/import-batches/B/package<br/>X-Content-SHA256: Dpackage
    API->>Stage: Stream to tenant quarantine, recompute digest, scan archive
    Stage-->>API: Clean immutable package Dpackage
    API->>Stage: Set B = uploaded
    API-->>UI: 204 No Content

    UI->>API: POST /v1/import-batches/B/dry-run<br/>If-Match: "Dpackage"
    API->>Stage: Confirm package digest and B = uploaded
    API->>Worker: Queue deterministic validation of B
    API-->>UI: 202 validating
    Worker->>Stage: Parse manifest/CSV/evidence and validate references and policy
    Worker->>Worker: Reject AUTH-HIST-001...006 when present
    Worker->>Stage: Write immutable report R with Dapply and eligibility
    Note over Worker,Ledger: Validation inserts no part, event, attachment, evidence link, or final decision.

    UI->>API: GET /v1/import-batches/B/report
    API->>Stage: Read immutable report R
    API-->>UI: 200 validated or rejected report

    alt Report rejected or expired
        UI->>UI: Disable Apply and display findings
        Operator->>UI: Correct package and create new batch
        UI->>API: POST apply with R (attempt)
        API-->>UI: 409 IMPORT-APPLY-001 or 410 expired
    else Report validated and reviewed
        Note over Operator,Audit: Logical Phase 2 — explicit human apply with one atomic tenant transaction.
        Operator->>UI: Review report and confirm APPLY PRE-ACCEPTANCE BASELINE
        UI->>API: POST /v1/import-batches/B/apply<br/>Idempotency-Key: K2 and If-Match: "Dapply"
        API->>API: Re-verify session, membership, permission, report expiry, package digest, policy version

        alt Same K2 + same report/precondition
            API-->>UI: 202 original apply job J (no duplicate ledger writes)
        else Same K2 + different request or stale Dapply
            API-->>UI: 409 idempotency or precondition conflict
        else Eligible and fresh request
            API->>Ledger: BEGIN with local organization context
            Ledger->>Ledger: Insert revisions, units, clean attachments, links,<br/>allowed pre-acceptance events, source-key mappings
            Ledger->>Ledger: Enforce RLS, append-only policy, and event sequencing
            Ledger->>Audit: Append legacy_import audit event with B/R/Dapply
            Ledger->>Ledger: COMMIT (all records) or ROLLBACK (none)
            API->>Stage: Set B = applied and J terminal state
            API-->>UI: 202 apply job J
            UI->>API: GET /v1/import-batches/B/apply-jobs/J
            API-->>UI: 200 applied + committed counts + audit event ID
        end
    end

    Note over Operator,Audit: Historical acceptance, NCR close/waiver, and shipment are never created by this import path.
